# meshy.ai

> Meshy is an AI-powered 3D content generation platform that transforms text prompts and images into production-ready 3D models in minutes. Trusted by 12M+ creators worldwide including game developers, 3D artists, VFX studios, and product designers. Features include Text-to-3D, Image-to-3D, AI Texturing, AI Animation with 600+ motion presets, and a developer API. Meshy 7 is our latest foundation model, available for Image-to-3D in the Meshy app and for both text and image input over the API, tuned for geometry alignment between the input and the generated 3D model. Image-to-3D generation offers three resolution tiers: Standard, Ultra 2K, and Ultra 4K. Ultra 4K generates geometry at 4096³ — a first for any 3D generative model — for intricate assets with fine detail. Ultra 2K and Ultra 4K require a paid plan and take longer to generate. Export to all major formats (FBX, OBJ, GLB, USDZ, STL, BLEND, 3MF, DXF). Enterprise-ready with ISO 27001 and SOC2 certification.

## Core Features

- [Text to 3D AI Generator](https://www.meshy.ai/features/text-to-3d): Generate production-ready 3D models from text descriptions using Meshy's AI. Create characters, props, vehicles, and environments with PBR textures. Supports Smart Topology mode for game-ready assets and high-detail sculpting for cinematic quality.
- [Image to 3D AI Converter](https://www.meshy.ai/features/image-to-3d): Transform 2D images, concept art, and photos into detailed 3D models. Upload single or multiple reference images for multi-view consistency. Ideal for turning sketches, product photos, and artwork into 3D assets.
- [AI Texture Generator](https://www.meshy.ai/features/ai-texture-generator): Apply AI-generated PBR textures to any 3D model. Create realistic materials, stylized looks, or match specific art styles. Includes texture healing and smart repair tools for fixing imperfections.
- [AI Animation Generator](https://www.meshy.ai/features/ai-animation-generator): Automatically rig and animate 3D characters with 600+ motion presets. One-click auto-rigging for bipeds and quadrupeds. Export animations to Unity, Unreal, Blender, and other game engines.
- [Meshy 3D Agent](https://www.meshy.ai/features/3d-agent): Conversational AI agent for 3D creation — describe what you want and the Agent brainstorms, generates, refines, and exports in one chat. Now available on the Free plan, running on a more capable foundation model, with 21 official templates to start from in Discover.
- [All Features Overview](https://www.meshy.ai/features): Complete overview of Meshy's AI-powered 3D generation capabilities including Text-to-3D, Image-to-3D, AI Texturing, Animation, and workflow tools for professional 3D content creation.

## 3D Tools

- [Free 3D File Converter](https://www.meshy.ai/3d-tools/file-converter): Convert between 3D file formats online for free. Supports FBX, OBJ, GLB, GLTF, STL, USDZ, BLEND, and more. Batch conversion available with texture preservation and mesh optimization.
- [Online 3D Model Viewer](https://www.meshy.ai/3d-tools/online-viewer): View and inspect 3D models directly in your browser. Supports all major formats including FBX, OBJ, GLB, and STL. Examine geometry, textures, and animations without installing software.
- [3D Model Splitter](https://www.meshy.ai/3d-tools/3d-model-splitter): Split a 3D model into printable parts online. Auto Split cuts along natural part boundaries and accepts a plain-language description of the parts you want separated (for example, "separate the wings from the body"), then caps every surface watertight, arranges the parts on the build plate, and exports a print-ready 3MF (imports STL, OBJ, or GLB).

